          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwei wa mũonza, mũthenya wa mĩongo ĩlĩ na ũmwe wa mwei, ndeto ya Yeova yooka na kanyw’a wa mwathani Akai, ĩkyasya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neena yu na Nzeluvaveli mwana wa Sealitieli ngavana wa Yuta, na Yosua mwana wa Yeosataki, mũthembi mũnene, na ũtialo wa andũ, ũmakũlye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũũ ũtiele katĩ wenyu ũla wonie nyũmba ĩno yĩ na ũtheu wayo wa mbee? Na mwĩmyona ata yu? Ti ta mana methonĩ menyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
